      "type": "text",
      "text": "Phimosis = norm in children and typically resolves by age 5; tx isn't required w.o comp (balanitis, UTIs, outlet obstruct). Betamethasone cream 0.05% 2 to 3 times a day to the tip of the foreskin for 3 months = often effective; circumcision if conservative measures fail."
